#. 希望ヶ峰学園の３階…
#. 今度は、この３階が開放されたのか…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The 3rd floor of Hope's Peak Academy... I wonder what\n"
"we're gonna find this time..."
msgstr ""

#. ここには…何があるんだ？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What's...up here?"
msgstr ""

#. 今度は…３階が解放されていた…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So the 3rd floor opened up this time..."
msgstr ""

#. ざっと見たところ、
#. 物理室や美術室などがあるようね。
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"After a brief investigation, it looks like there's a\n"
"physics lab and an art room."
msgstr ""

#. 特に、物理室には何か巨大な機械があるけど…
#. あれは、なんなのかしら…？
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I also found a huge machine of some kind in the\n"
"physics lab. I wonder what it does..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>上り階段があるけど…
#. シャッターが降りてる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are stairs leading up...but the gate's blocking\n"
"my way.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ…上があるのかよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So there's still at least one more floor...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
